==Battleground==
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 8~20 seconds<sup>240f~600f</sup>.
*15 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.33~6 seconds<sup>10f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s (1,200%) spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 8~20 seconds<sup>240f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 8~20 seconds<sup>240f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns.
**10 [[Squire Rel]]s (800%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns.
**10 [[Squire Rel]]s (800%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Squire Rel]]s (800%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Note that if you sync the Bun Buns, the battle will become much easier. However, due to varied health and knockbacks, it is easy for them to get knocked back and will then proceed to plow your front line. Area Cats such as [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] can knockback the Bun Buns back together, so that they are synced to make the battle easier. There is a long distance between bases, so don't spam to many meatshields before hitting the base in order to avoid hitting the deploy limit. Using Single Target debuffers is likely a bad idea, but they will serve as insurance should [[Delinquent Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Delinquent Cat]] or [[Bodhisattva Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bodhisattva Cat]]'s Area Attacks falter. Without the support of Area Attack units, they will likely hit the Hippoes instead and by the time any Bahamuts or Ubers have taken care of the Hippoes, the line would be pushed, and they would be dead. Having [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] can also greatly help due to the Slow against Floating. Since all of the Bun Buns are Floating, Monk Cat can stall them if you have it. Optionally bringing [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] for the early rush of Shadow Boxers Might be a good idea.

